lishing Almoravid monuments, including the palace on whose site the Koutoubia rose; &quot;governing ... from a desert capital&quot; <span aria-hidden="true">→</span><span class="sr-only"> became </span> removed (Marrakesh is not a desert capital).</span></li><li><span class="corr-was">Almoravid military advantage &quot;Saharan light cavalry&quot; <span aria-hidden="true">→</span><span class="sr-only"> became </span> disciplined infantry ranks backed by cavalry (Almoravid armies were noted for infantry formations); camel tactic hedged.</span></li></ul></details>
